{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAsBPLeK29Q7tSXAUXKE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The deploy script now sets `Cache-Control` on every object it uploads. I did not deploy anything. I tested the script with a stub `aws` that only prints its arguments.\n\n- **HTML, JS and CSS** get `public, max-age=300` (5 minutes).\n- **`assets/`** gets `public, max-age=86400` (1 day).\n\nChanges are in `scripts/deploy.sh`. The script first checks that every file has a known extension, then runs the existing `sync --delete`, then re-uploads each file with `--content-type` and `--cache-control` set explicitly. It never uses the S3 self-copy with `--metadata-directive REPLACE` that the notes file warns about. The CloudFront invalidation is unchanged.\n\nChoices I made that you may want to change:\n- **CSS is short-lived.** You named HTML and JS; `styles.css` sits at the root, not under `assets/`, so I grouped it with the short policy.\n- **Assets cache for one day, not a year with `immutable`.** The filenames aren't hashed, so a year-long cache would leave an updated `logo.png` stuck on visitors' browsers.\n- **`charset=utf-8` on HTML, JS and CSS.** The files contain `ñ`, `á` and similar characters.\n\nI also tested the failure path: a `favicon.ico` in `src/` makes the script exit before any upload.\n\nStill to do:\n- **Run `./scripts/deploy.sh` yourself.** Existing objects in the bucket have no cache header yet. The re-upload pass is what fixes them, even for unchanged files.\n- **Check the headers afterwards** with `curl -sI` on `/booking.js`, `/` and `/assets/logo.png`.\n- **README** still describes the missing header as a known problem. I left it alone since you didn't ask for it.\n\nEverything is written up in `ANSWER.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1424,"cache_read_input_tokens":33476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1424},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5de02a7a-1fc6-4265-b3c4-407d2b02b9b4","uuid":"0bad0d33-8e9b-4703-bcbc-e83a28e0dc4f","timestamp":"2026-10-19T03:13:19.026Z","request_id":"req_011CgAsBNzJvdf3EZB1LYXao"}
